1
00:00:00,528 --> 00:00:02,668
(Sheldon:)Isn't that a little juvenile?

2
00:00:02,665 --> 00:00:04,735
(Amy:)More juvenile than this?

3
00:00:08,336 --> 00:00:09,636
(Sheldon:)I'll get the blankets.

4
00:00:09,638 --> 00:00:10,968
(Sheldon:)You Google how
to have childlike fun.

5
00:00:14,709 --> 00:00:16,409
(Sheldon:)You know what,
I'm being a bad host.

6
00:00:16,412 --> 00:00:17,742
(Howard:)Let me get some more coffee.

7
00:00:17,746 --> 00:00:19,976
(Bernadette:)Oh, let me do it, Howard.
No, I got it.

8
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:23,880
(Bernadette:)So, Josh, what do you do?

9
00:00:23,886 --> 00:00:26,256
(Josh:)I'm studying oceanography
down in San Diego.

10
00:00:26,255 --> 00:00:28,325
(Bernadette:)Oh, how nice.

11
00:00:32,226 --> 00:00:34,826
I loved Finding Nemo.

12
00:00:35,897 --> 00:00:35,898
(Raj:)Enough chitchat.

13
00:00:35,898 --> 00:00:38,598
(Raj:)How do we know you are
who you say you are?

14
00:00:38,601 --> 00:00:41,031
(Josh:)Why would I lie?

15
00:00:41,036 --> 00:00:43,006
(Raj:)Okay, you got me there.

16
00:00:44,405 --> 00:00:46,875
(Raj:)You here looking for money?
No.

17
00:00:46,875 --> 00:00:49,375
(Raj:)A kidney, cornea,
piece of his liver?

18
00:00:49,378 --> 00:00:50,778
(Howard:)No.

19
00:00:50,779 --> 00:00:52,749
(Raj:)You're in a Beatles cover band

20
00:00:52,748 --> 00:00:55,818
(Raj:)and you need Howard to replace
your dad as Ringo.

21
00:00:57,285 --> 00:00:59,115
(Bernadette:)Why don't you help
with the coffee?

22
00:00:59,121 --> 00:01:02,051
(Raj:)Okay, but something
smells fishy.

